TB2 Manager

This application incorporates adaptations of SPI Mem Manager, from
flipperdevices/flipperzero-good-faps commit efc32b71838d3d5e8d604c1ba7a4793916d5212f.
The corresponding combined application is distributed under GNU GPL version 3;
see LICENSE. Upstream copyright and license notices are retained.

src/spi.c adapts the command/worker sequences for W25Q128FV, with bounded IO,
checked errors, UID binding, persistence checkpoints and retry handling.
assets/icons/Wiring_SPI_128x64.png is an unchanged upstream graphic.
Exact provenance and image hash: third_party/spi_mem_manager/provenance.json.

The Core Flasher feature incorporates a reduced MPSSE/USB adaptation of FlipTDI
by Skorpionm / SkorP from flipperdevices/flipperzero-good-faps. The integration
is loaded only for a Core Flasher session, uses the existing external 2-MHz SPI pin
profile and forwards raw SPI transactions without a flash-command policy in firmware. The standalone
scenes, UART, timer-driven bitbang modes and upstream wiring graphic are not
included. Exact source/archive provenance is recorded in
third_party/flip_tdi/provenance.json; the GPLv3 text is retained there.

Mbed TLS, pinned 107ea89daaefb9867ea9121002fbbdf926780e98: Apache-2.0.
littlefs, pinned adad0fbbcf5382c20978d07f94f9c13be9041c1b: BSD-3-Clause.
tools/prepare.ps1 obtains these pinned sources for local builds, copies their
license texts into the ignored dependency tree, and documents the small LittleFS
mount guard. Generated dependency copies are not stored in this repository.

The Flipper/Unleashed SDK is a separately obtained, pinned build prerequisite.
No private box dumps, keys, personal settings, or local packages are distributed.
